msgid ""
"Collection date %(date)s violates the %(days)s-day pre-notification window "
"required by SEPA. Push the batch's payment date out to %(min)s or later, or "
"shorten pre_notification_days on the creditor config if your bank permits."
msgstr ""
"La fecha de cobro %(date)s incumple el plazo de preaviso de %(days)s días "
"exigido por SEPA. Aplace la fecha de pago del lote a %(min)s o posterior, o "
"reduzca pre_notification_days en la configuración del acreedor si su banco "
"lo permite."

